# sixfiveohtwo stage 5 expectations.
# Read-modify-write ops: ASL/LSR/ROL/ROR (accumulator and memory
# forms) and INC/DEC across zp, zp,X, abs, abs,X.
#
# All checks apply at the single final marker (M line below): the
# last data write is lda #$5A / sta $F000; lda #$5A leaves N=0, Z=0,
# and C=0 (the last C-setting event is the clc in the ROR abs,X
# block; INC/DEC never touch C), V=0 (clv in the INC/DEC zp block,
# never set again), D=0 and I=1 (untouched reset values). SP is $FD
# (every PHP is paired with a PLA). X=$01 (ldx #$01 in the DEC abs,X
# block, never changed after), Y=$27 (set once at the start, never
# changed after). PC is the address after the final 3-byte sta $F000.
#
# Flag bytes captured by PHP/PLA: P is pushed as N V 1 B D I Z C, so
# bit5=1 and B=1 always, and the base byte is $34 (I=1, V=D=Z=C=0,
# N=0). E.g. $B4=N1, $37=C1 Z1, $36=Z1 with C=0, $B5=N1 C1.

M F000 5A

F N 0
F Z 0
F C 0
F V 0
F D 0
F I 1
R A 5A
R X 01
R Y 27
R S FD
R P 051A

# --- ASL A: C-out 0/1, N set, zero result, C-in ignored ---
C F100 34
C F101 02
C F102 37
C F103 00
C F104 B4
C F105 80
C F106 34
C F107 02

# --- LSR A: C-out 0/1, N cleared, zero result ---
C F108 34
C F109 01
C F10A 35
C F10B 01
C F10C 34
C F10D 40
C F10E 37
C F10F 00

# --- ROL A: C-in 0/1, zero result, C-out 0/1 ---
C F110 34
C F111 02
C F112 37
C F113 00
C F114 34
C F115 03
C F116 35
C F117 01

# --- ROR A: C-in 0/1, zero result ---
C F118 34
C F119 01
C F11A 37
C F11B 00
C F11C B4
C F11D 81
C F11E B4
C F11F 80

# --- shift chains: carry handed ASL->ROL->ROL and LSR->ROR->ROR ---
C F120 34
C F121 01
C F122 34
C F123 40

# --- zp memory shifts: flag bytes (C-out, N set, N cleared) ---
C F124 35
C F125 B4
C F126 34
C F127 35
C F128 B4
C F129 B4
C F12A B4
C F12B 35

# --- zp INC/DEC: A untouched, wraps, C/V untouched ---
C F148 99
C F12C B4
C F12D 36
C F12E 36
C F12F B4
C F130 B5

# --- zp,X memory shifts + INC/DEC: flag bytes, X untouched ---
C F131 B4
C F132 02
C F133 35
C F134 B5
C F135 35
C F136 B5
C F137 37
C F138 B4
C F139 C9

# --- abs memory shifts + INC/DEC: flag bytes ---
C F13A 34
C F13B 37
C F13C B4
C F13D 34
C F13E 37
C F13F 37
C F140 B5

# --- abs,X memory shifts + INC/DEC: A/X untouched, flag bytes ---
C F149 77
C F141 B5
C F142 03
C F143 35
C F144 37
C F145 B4
C F146 B4
C F147 36

# --- written-back cells, zero page shifts ---
C 10 82
C 11 42
C 12 42
C 13 01
C 14 80
C 15 81
C 16 81
C 17 01

# --- zp,X wrap: target $18 hit, base $4F and neighbor untouched ---
C 18 FF
C 19 66
C 4F 99

# --- written-back cells + decoys, zp,X clusters ---
C 20 11
C 21 22
C 22 33
C 23 FE
C 24 44
C 25 55
C 26 42
C 27 66
C 28 FD
C 30 77
C 31 88
C 32 3F
C 33 99
C 34 80
C 35 AA
C 36 00
C 37 BB

# --- INC/DEC zp results ---
C 40 80
C 41 00
C 42 00
C 43 FE

# --- written-back cells, absolute ---
C F200 02
C F201 00
C F202 40
C F203 81
C F204 00
C F205 00
C F206 FF

# --- written-back cells + decoys, abs,X clusters ---
C F210 D1
C F211 D2
C F212 D3
C F213 82
C F214 D4
C F215 E1
C F216 E2
C F217 20
C F218 E3
C F219 F9
C F21A 00
C F21B FA
C F21C 80
C F220 F1
C F221 F2
C F222 F3
C F223 FF
C F224 F4
C F225 A1
C F226 00
C F227 A2
